<div class="page-head">
  <div><a class="back" href="/admin/jihozlar">← Jihozlar</a><h1>Jihozlarni Excel dan yuklash</h1></div>
</div>

{{> errors}}
{{#if qatorXatolari}}
<div class="alert alert-xato" role="alert">
  <strong>Faylda {{xatoSoni}} ta xato topildi — hech narsa saqlanmadi.</strong> Tuzatib, qayta yuklang.
  <ul>{{#each qatorXatolari}}<li>{{qator}}-qator: {{xato}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
  {{#if (gt xatoSoni 50)}}<p>Dastlabki 50 tasi ko'rsatildi.</p>{{/if}}
</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="grid-2">
  <section class="card">
    <h2>1. Namunani yuklab oling</h2>
    <p>Ustunlar: <b>Bino | Qavat | Xona | Jihoz turi | Belgisi | Inventar raqami</b>.</p>
    <ul class="muted small">
      <li>Bino va jihoz turi tizimdagi nomga mos bo'lsin (namunadagi "Ma'lumotnoma" varag'ida ro'yxat bor).</li>
      <li>Bazada yo'q xona avtomatik yaratiladi — buning uchun qavat ko'rsatilsin.</li>
      <li>Inventar raqami ixtiyoriy, lekin takrorlanmasin.</li>
      <li>Bir martada 2000 tagacha qator. Bitta xato bo'lsa ham hech narsa saqlanmaydi.</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin/jihozlar/namuna.xlsx">{{> icon name="download"}}Namuna (.xlsx)</a>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>2. To'ldirilgan faylni yuklang</h2>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/jihozlar/import" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="stack">
      {{> csrf}}
      <label class="upload">{{> icon name="download"}}<span>.xlsx faylni tanlang (2 MB gacha)</span>
        <input type="file" name="fayl" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" required></label>
      <div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Yuklash</button></div>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
